<title>USA: Vulcan International to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Vulcan International to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vulcan International Corp on Thursday said its directors had approved the repurchase of up to 100,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said purchases would occur &quot;at such prices and upon such terms as the president may determine to be in the best interests of the company.&quot;</p>
<p>Vulcan International Corp, the parent company of Vulcan Corp, manufactures components for shoe manufacturing, bowling pins and plastic products.</p>
